      "rationale": "Tisekta: taɣudent tettwaẓẓa s ueccen n usẓi, dṣa n tfesna d yiwen n ufus n ttawla (ṭepaḥ)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "סביב סביב",
      "rationale": "Tulsa n wawal 'tbeggeṭ ttbeggeṭ' — tigti n tɣuztant, tettwaseggeḍ s tulsa deg teqbaylit."
    },
    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "אמה וטפח",
      "rationale": "Tifesna-a tegda tfesna tamaynut tameqqrant (cubit) i ttwaṣṣfen daxel n usẓi; kra n yimsuqlen gguten ad snulfun taɣ rich n tfesna n umenzel n teqdimt."
    },
    {
      "kind": "hapax",
      "subject": "הבנין",
      "rationale": "Awal הבנין (lebni) ur yella ara deg umkan-nniḍen n Tanakh."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Walay, taɣudent beṛṛa n wexxam, tuɣza-t tbeggeṭ ttbeggeṭ; deg ufus n wemdan yella yiwen n ueccen n usẓi, dṣa n tfesna s tfesna, d yiwen n ufus (ṭepaḥ); yis-ixḍa ⟨את⟩ teɣzi n lebni, yiwen n ueccen, d tattuyt, yiwen n ueccen.",
